\frac{1-\cos x}{x}
&\cdot\frac{1+\cos x}{1+\cos x}\\
&=\frac{1-\cos^2x}{x(1+\cos x)}\\
&=\frac{\sin^2x}{x(1+\cos x)}\\
&=\frac{\sin x}{x}\cdot\frac{\sin x}{1+\cos x}.
